OL,3,GNEWSALonger-term housing arranged after
OL,4,Ahuge blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have begun moving on from
OL,7,Femergency accommodation into long-term
OL,8,Fhousing after a devastating fire in
OL,9,FStoke-on-Trent destroyed their homes.
OL,11,FThe city council said it had ben
OL,12,Frunning a 24/7 helpline for affected
OL,13,Fresidents in Sandyford to provide
OL,14,Finformation and support.
OL,16,FStaff from the authority have been
OL,17,Fworking with charities MIND and
OL,18,FCitizens Advice to answer questions
OL,19,Ffrom residents.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
